<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6532"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 4:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I hesitate to throw this out, but here goes. <BR>Suppose instead of taking still shots only, BTK has been taping also.  <BR><a href="http://www.internetvideomag.com/articles2002/historyofcamcorders.htm" target=_top>http://www.internetvideomag.com/articles2002/histo ryofcamcorders.htm</a>  <BR>The messages from the alledged BTK mentioned SOULS FOR SALE&#40;Sell&#41;. The portable cam corder became available in hand held form around 1974-75 and was available in shoulder model a couple of years before. Around 74 would be when an expensive, but realatively small model &#40;B/W&#41; would become generally available. <BR> <BR>Snuff films have been the stuff of urban ledgend for years but no one has ever found/seen one. <BR> <BR>Suppose the whole psycho thing &#40;not suppose, it obviously is&#41; is BS and his sorry ass monster has nothing to do with anything. Suppose that the motive was to make money from tapes which, I&#39;m sure some defective reprobate would pay serious bucks for. <BR> <BR>It would explain why Josephine was isolated, bound so thoroughly, and otherwise treated differently than the other Oteros. And his mention of doing the same to Shirley Vian&#39;s daughter &#40;maybe little jon too&#41;. <BR> <BR>If the semen was a plant it would explain BTK&#39;s lack of concern for a DNA match.  <BR> <BR>It would explain the gaps between killings and the fact that he could stop for so long. The copy-cat method, the reason he wrote: &#39;fall is the season&#39; and was able to last through the summer without the monster bothering him. <BR> <BR>Another thought, that I believe came up already is that he might be working as a technician or cameraman at one of the television stations in Wichita. Notice only KAKE gets messages. Swabs don&#39;t count now. <BR> <BR>Prostitutes have come up in posts, and have been discarded as not likely. However If he is in the porn business he might have used them as models, and be very well networked instead of a loner. It would also provide him with a source of Semen. <BR> <BR>Obviously, others would be involved so he could have had someone drop him at the target and pick him up if necessary. The victims would not have to have anything in common if more than one person was picking them out. <BR> <BR>Sorry to post this...I hadn&#39;t even gotten used to his &#39;old&#39; sick self. <BR> <BR>Afterthought. The driver&#39;s liscense. Proof to the buyer that the film is the actual death of the victim, who is named in the press, rather than staged. And...why he doesn&#39;t mind giving them back.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
